                  summary: "A dual-identity hero who presents a public face while pursuing justice as a masked avenger.",
                  desc: """
                  The vigilante maintains two separate identities — a social identity (a merchant, nobleman, or other public figure) and a vigilante identity (a masked hero or villain). Switching identities takes a minute and grants access to entirely different class features.
                  
                  In vigilante identity, the vigilante gains Vigilante Talents — a broad array of abilities ranging from combat tricks to social manipulation to supernatural powers. Many archetypes shift the vigilante toward different combat styles (avenger uses weapons, stalker focuses on sneak attacks and supernatural stealth).
                  
                  In social identity, the vigilante is effectively invisible — they gain a social bonus that makes them unrecognizable even to people who know their vigilante self. Startling Appearance allows the vigilante to emerge from hiding and apply a penalty on an enemy's attack rolls. The dual identity creates interesting roleplay opportunities and mechanical flexibility.
                  """,
