                  summary: "A wild shapechanging warrior who permanently bonds with aspects of the animal kingdom.",
                  desc: """
                  The shifter is a martial class that specializes in permanent, reliable wild shape rather than the druid's spell-based transformation. Shifters can maintain their forms almost indefinitely and gain access to multiple aspects — partial transformations that grant specific animal traits.
                  
                  Shifter's Fury allows the shifter to make additional natural attacks while in shifted form, scaling with level. Chimeric Aspect at higher levels allows the shifter to combine traits from multiple aspects simultaneously, creating hybrid forms with claws, flight, and enhanced senses all active at once.
                  
                  Wild Shape functions differently from the druid: the shifter changes specific body parts rather than the whole body. Claws of the beast, tiger aspect, and falcon aspect all grant specific physical bonuses while leaving the shifter's overall form mostly humanoid. At the apex, the shifter's Final Form allows a full beast shape with all gained aspects active simultaneously.
